<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on FOB Omaha basis carlot prices of fabricated beef cuts and on industry yields  as of 3:00 PM, boxed beef generally firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice chuck, round and rib cuts were firm, while loin cuts were steady to weak. Beef trimmings were not established. -- USDA Market News</p>
<p>   55 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>   50s Lds    550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>Grd Lds     ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =	99.68	 99.36	 93.73	 93.51</p>
<p>		   0.21	  0.20	  0.64	  0.48</p>
